{
  "mn151:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 151 ",
  "mn151:0.2": "Piṇḍapātapārisuddhisutta ",
  "mn151:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn151:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati veḷuvane kalandakanivāpe. ",
  "mn151:1.3": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho āyasmantaṁ sāriputtaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn151:2.1": "“Vippasannāni kho te, sāriputta, indriyāni, parisuddho chavivaṇṇo pariyodāto. ",
  "mn151:2.2": "Katamena kho tvaṁ, sāriputta, vihārena etarahi bahulaṁ viharasī”ti? ",
  "mn151:2.3": "“Suññatāvihārena kho ahaṁ, bhante, etarahi bahulaṁ viharāmī”ti. ",
  "mn151:2.4": "“Sādhu sādhu, sāriputta. ",
  "mn151:2.5": "Mahāpurisavihārena kira tvaṁ, sāriputta, etarahi bahulaṁ viharasi. ",
  "mn151:2.6": "Mahāpurisavihāro eso, sāriputta, yadidaṁ—",
  "mn151:2.7": "suññatā. ",
  "mn151:3.1": "Tasmātiha, sāriputta, bhikkhu sace ākaṅkheyya: ",
  "mn151:3.2": "‘suññatāvihārena bahulaṁ vihareyyan’ti, tena, sāriputta, bhikkhunā iti paṭisañcikkhitabbaṁ: ",
  "mn151:3.3": "‘yena cāhaṁ maggena gāmaṁ piṇḍāya pāvisiṁ, yasmiñca padese piṇḍāya acariṁ, yena ca maggena gāmato piṇḍāya paṭikkamiṁ, atthi nu kho me tattha cakkhuviññeyyesu rūpesu chando vā rāgo vā doso vā moho vā paṭighaṁ vāpi cetaso’ti? ",
  "mn151:3.4":